 shigaraki  with the blowback pushing shoto to the  ground we then see that tenure is  starting to carry back ago away from the  battlefield  but the barely conscious back ago tells  ida to put him down  as he needs to win this fight against  shigaraki obviously either refuses his  request  and reminds bakugo that his internal  organs were ripped which is  a valid observation i don't think  bakugou should even be attempting  to get back into the fight moving on to  endeavour  he's been lying on the ground in a whole  heap of pain and his internal dialogue  he kind of like  apologizes to hawks for allowing  shigaraki to wake up  in endeavour's mind the reason shigaraki  woke up is because of his own failures  and he goes on to think that his lungs  are a bit burnt after the last  prominence burn  meaning he is now at his limit this  right here is the moment  when debbie greets endeavour while still  standing on gigantomachia's shoulders  and the number one hero looks up from  the ground and just says  darby the villain replies by telling  endeavor not to call him that name  before whipping out a bottle of  mysterious liquid i don't know  what exactly this liquid is maybe  someone who's dyed their hair before can  tell me  but dabi pours this liquid all over his  hair and his hair begins to change color  from  black to white in the manga it's been  shown many times  that toyotaroki had white hair although  in the anime it was red hair so  i guess this scene will be slightly  different when we see it animated in  season six  with dabby's hair now totally white he  tells endeavour not to call him darby  because toya is a great name darby is  toyah  confirmed we've had all the theories you  know you if you're a follower of me  you've seen it on my channel many times  dabi is toyah we've thought it for a  long time it is now 100 confirmed and  man this is the best news to wake up to  before we move on  i just got to say that horukoshi is a  genius because it was exactly 100  chapters ago  in in chapter 190 that dabby encountered  endeavor for the first time  and now this reveal happens you know  like i said exactly  100 chapters later on the dot so clearly  he's been planning this out  very precisely and i can only commend  him for that it's  honestly amazing work the scene then  pans back to the hospital  with rey watching on the tv from the  translations we have so far  debbie goes on to call himself  toyotaroki in this broadcast  and states that he was born the oldest  son of the endeavor family  toyo goes on to reveal that he has  killed more than 30 innocent people  across the course of his life  and now he wants everyone to know what  led him to do these terrible  things clearly toya's plan to destroy  society's faith in heroes  is to let them know that the number one  hero is the one who led him down this  path of villainy  i mean no wonder he's been so happy  recently i  imagine that next chapter debbie will  elaborate on exactly what happened to  him  and maybe my theory about him and hawks  being in the government training program  will be revealed um but yeah for now  this is all we have we don't exactly  know why  he has all these scars and everything  like that but you know what  next chapter i i'm assuming it will come  back to the battlefield  we see the horrified expressions of both  shoto and endeavour  as they react to the news that the  eldest todoroki sun  who they assumed to just died is  standing in front of them  and is on the side of the villains  imagine how they must feel right now  i mean yeah we as an audience suspected  dabi as toyah for a long time  by the way check out my video breaking  down all the clues but  todoroki you know he had no idea that  debbie was toyah neither did endeavor  so this is just probably the most  shocking news they've ever heard in  their lives  toya genuinely starts dancing like the  joker and says that he's been thinking  about  all the ways to make endeavour's life  miserable he tells the number one hero  to his face  that he was wrong to think he could just  move past his previous actions  and that the past cannot be erased the  final panel is a close-up  of both shoto and endeavour and dabi  tells his dad that he can dance with him  in hell which uh concludes this chapter  i gotta say that when my hero academia  is over whenever that will be  this right here will be will go down as  one of its most iconic chapters i mean  yeah it's just amazing like finally we  got it guys we got it  it feels great even though like i said  we all knew he was toyah  but we just needed this we just needed  this reveal and  hopefully in the next few chapters we  elaborate on it a bit more you know  the backstory but i can't tell you how  excited i was when i saw these spoilers  in the morning  and uh for those that don't know every  sunday i do a page by page reaction to  the latest chapters on twitch  so obviously i'll be doing it again this  week so you do not want to miss that  it'll be 5 p.m uk time which i believe  is like 1 p.m  uh eastern time in america um so yeah be  sure to check out my twitch stream  and of course you know for the rest of  this week i'll also be doing a couple  more  debbie toya videos just explaining a few  more things but until the next one  peace out
 

